Scenario: Generate new DXP aggregate license via download button via subscription details
	Testing the ability to generate an aggregate license via download button via the subscription details page for a T4 DXP project from koroneiki on provisioning

	Given I generate a provisioning project name
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORLICKORLIC                         | |
